{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8ad0f5c63eb4a2a1f96aa684c0afb6e6.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8ad0f5c63eb4a2a1f96aa684c0afb6e6.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8ad0f5c63eb4a2a1f96aa684c0afb6e6.mp4?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>An ethereal, pulp spraying, contemplative stroll from one end of a city to the other.<br><br>As the little combat wizard Lumi, you'll use the &quot;Arcana&quot; to fight a geyser of cute, and clever spirit bunnies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8a8c9120a20a2658ea8d2ccd8fc9ecee.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8a8c9120a20a2658ea8d2ccd8fc9ecee.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8a8c9120a20a2658ea8d2ccd8fc9ecee.mp4?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combat in &quot;The Girl Who Kicked a Rabbit&quot; is designed as an easy-going experience, with a whole basket of meticulously crafted mechanics to fiddle around with.<br><br>Every element of the game is engineered to react in the fastest, most responsive way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/c9440c9b87eb4dbfefaf1fc7741414d5.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/c9440c9b87eb4dbfefaf1fc7741414d5.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/c9440c9b87eb4dbfefaf1fc7741414d5.mp4?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Selecting one of your astral weapons and obliterating a long-eared bugger, is an interface delight. The bunnies will hold &quot;Catalysts&quot;, that you'll need in order to win.<br><br>Understanding which of these otherworldly baubles you need, and actually getting them before they disappear, will be half the battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/37ccac1d685661504b735fc785b34990.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/37ccac1d685661504b735fc785b34990.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/37ccac1d685661504b735fc785b34990.mp4?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>No reason to get all tricked out before the next hand-to-hand: Every battle gives you a different collection of mystical &quot;Arcana&quot; to wield. Some of them are good to go, and others you have to unlock on the job.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/d827f90875e025062b723ebcc511f554.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/d827f90875e025062b723ebcc511f554.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/d827f90875e025062b723ebcc511f554.mp4?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Murdering doe-eyed bunny beasts isn't enough to win! Somehow, you'll need to get enough &quot;Gods' Wine&quot; to close the flaming portals that keep sending out more opponents.<br><br>Sometimes the rabbits will drop this celestial nectar, and sometimes a more economic approach is required.<br><br>If you've got a little chemist inside you somewhere, perhaps you'd prefer making your own divine kombucha.<br>Good thing every critter killed is a pi\u00f1ata of goo-covered treasure.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2427130?t=1766314726","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2427130?t=1766314726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/e70007959c0a7947705038ba15ef0e2ec8081f53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766314726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/e70007959c0a7947705038ba15ef0e2ec8081f53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766314726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2482320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8ad0f5c63eb4a2a1f96aa684c0afb6e6.poster.avif?t=1766314726\" width=618 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/extras/8ad0f5c63eb4a2a1f96aa684c0afb6e6.webm?t=1766314726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat