 you've got a little chemist inside you somewhere, perhaps you'd prefer making your own divine kombucha.<br>Good thing every critter killed is a pi\u00f1ata of goo-covered treasure.","developers":["takunomi"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2427130/header.jpg?t=1766314726","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHz dual-core Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000 with 384MB of DDR3 SDRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427130/1163184179/512ce20ba1c4d280b5c315fc85669f54a4827907/1762342457/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762343126","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427130/1163184179/512ce20ba1c4d280b5c315fc85669f54a4827907/1762342457/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762343126","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427130/1163184179/512ce20ba1c4d280b5c315fc85669f54a4827907/1762342457/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762343126","id":257227085,"name":"The Girl Who Kicked a Rabbit - Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257227085/61fd45dacc4ddcfd881289b2e988d1b85c687df5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762343126"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2427130/1757580882/7b2228d3986e928092b5c1877b2af6837d3ebaaf/1762342770/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762343124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailer